  m_text: 'Was called at 2am by manager. 3 days before Orpheus launch. Maintenance
    time: 6 hours. Issue: poorly installed and poorly fit hydraulic pumps, negligence.
    Replaced. Got yelled at by manager anyways. Grit my teeth and took it. I really
    need this job to keep food on the table for my family.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
